("`Error`", "0x0006", "peer ↔ peer", "RPC error code (UNIMPLEMENTED, UNAUTHENTICATED, TOO_LARGE, VERSION, RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED, ...) with a retry hint", "§6.5"),
